{title: MAINTY AHO ZEZE MAHANORI}
{artist: KAIAMBA}

Mainty aho ! Mainty aho ! Mainty aho !

Mainty aho izany angamba
no tsy hitiavana ahy
Fotsy ianao izany
no hireharehanao
Aiza re ireo fahasambarana
nodiavina taloha
Maty ve ny fitovian-jo

